# Normalize text to LF in the repository. Both parsers read CRLF and LF identically, so a Windows
# working copy is fine — but the stored form must be one thing, or every cross-platform commit is a
# whole-file diff.
* text=auto

# Generated workbooks are ZIP containers. Line-ending conversion would corrupt them outright, and
# would break the byte-reproducibility check CI runs against the committed example.
*.xlsx binary
